abel pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Quest</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">12.90.12182<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 18, 2022<br/>Summer Update 2022</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Quests</nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-quest-legend\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Legend\">Legend</span></h3>\n<p class=\"no-results\">This quest has no legend.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Gnomprona\">Gnomprona</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-dangers\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dangers\">Dangers</span></h3>\n<p class=\"no-results\">This quest has no dangers.</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-reward\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Reward\">Reward</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire-Fighter%20Outfits\">Fire-Fighter Outfits</a> and addons, <a href=\"#/wiki/Friendly%20Fire\">Friendly Fire</a> Achievement<br/>\n<span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire-Fighter%20Outfits\"><img alt=\"Fire-Fighter Outfits\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Fire_Fighter_Male_Addon_3_8507c4.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span>\n<span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire-Fighter%20Outfits\"><img alt=\"Fire-Fighter Outfits\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Fire_Fighter_Female_Addon_3_a754e8.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-spoiler\">\n<div class=\"tw-cmd showhide-visible showhide-init quest-spoiler\" data-command=\"showhide-content\" data-showhide-value=\"visible\">\n<div class=\"showhide-header\" data-showhide-element=\"header\">Click to show/hide the quest spoiler.<br/><span style=\"font-size: 0.8em;\">(settings)</span></div>\n<div class=\"showhide-body\" data-showhide-element=\"body\">\n<div class=\"spoiler-pretext\">Spoiler • edit</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Base_Outfits\">Base Outfits</span></h2>\n<p>Finish <a href=\"#/quest/primal-ordeal-quest\">Primal Ordeal Quest</a> by defeating <a href=\"#/wiki/Magma%20Bubble\">Magma Bubble</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-First_Addon\">First Addon</span></h2>\n<p>Use a <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Firefighting%20Axe\"><img alt=\"Firefighting Axe\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Firefighting_Axe_22b6e4.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Firefighting%20Axe\">Firefighting Axe</a>.<br/>\nYou will see the following message: <span class=\"sounds tibiatext tibiaorange\">You feel like fighting a fire!</span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Second_Addon\">Second Addon</span></h2>\n<p>Use a <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Portable%20Flame\"><img alt=\"Portable Flame\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Portable_Flame_907b8a.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Portable%20Flame\">Portable Flame</a>.<br/>\nYou will see the following message: <span class=\"sounds tibiatext tibiaorange\">The flame engulfs you!</span>\n</p><p>Upon using both items you will get the achievement <a href=\"#/wiki/Friendly%20Fire\">Friendly Fire</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>","quests":["primal-ordeal-quest"]}